1
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:14,000
The Milky Way turns in the sky.

2
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:16,040
In the human world...

3
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:18,760
The curtains fall in the human world.

4
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,080
Stars

5
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:28,800
exist beyond the Milky Way.

6
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,670
The departed souls on earth

7
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:33,650
will eventually become stars,

8
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:36,330
guarding their loved ones.

9
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,360
Then will my father

10
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,040
also be watching me from the sky?

11
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:51,480
Perhaps.

12
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:56,500
He is the brightest one.

13
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:13,170
No matter how the stars change,

14
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,460
I will be just like him,

15
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:18,060
guarding you.

16
00:01:21,660 --> 00:01:22,460
Really?

17
00:01:24,440 --> 00:01:26,039
The Big Dipper is my witness.

18
00:01:34,060 --> 00:01:35,300
Then can you tell me

19
00:01:35,940 --> 00:01:37,080
about my father?

20
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:41,830
What do you want to know?

21
00:01:42,039 --> 00:01:42,940
Anything.

22
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:46,940
I know too little about his life.

23
00:01:54,039 --> 00:01:54,840
Your father,

24
00:01:58,860 --> 00:02:01,060
he was a warrior who guarded the border.

25
00:02:02,740 --> 00:02:04,000
He fought alongside me

26
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,860
on the battlefield.

27
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:08,139
With countless military achievements,

28
00:02:08,139 --> 00:02:09,240
he was a true hero.

29
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,800
I knew it.

30
00:02:14,940 --> 00:02:16,200
I knew my father

31
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:17,940
wasn't like what they said.

32
00:02:18,660 --> 00:02:20,320
He must have been a great hero.

33
00:02:23,300 --> 00:02:24,100
Yes.

34
00:02:28,500 --> 00:02:29,120
Then,

35
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:32,020
should I call you Uncle?

36
00:02:33,740 --> 00:02:36,240
If I hadn't met you this time...

37
00:02:36,940 --> 00:02:38,440
Just call me by my name.

38
00:02:40,100 --> 00:02:40,940
Just now,

39
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,650
who was chasing you?

40
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,460
Some thieves.

41
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:48,900
Probably because of my identity.

42
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:54,660
After my father passed away,

43
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:57,900
I was adopted into Prince Ling's Manor

44
00:02:58,600 --> 00:02:59,800
as a foster daughter.

45
00:03:01,260 --> 00:03:02,460
Prince Ling's Manor?

46
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,600
How do they treat you?

47
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,040
Very well.

48
00:03:08,700 --> 00:03:09,620
They even

49
00:03:10,460 --> 00:03:12,990
betrothed me to the young master of the manor.

50
00:03:18,300 --> 00:03:18,980
My lord.

51
00:03:19,900 --> 00:03:21,900
I, Ling Ao, son of Prince Ling, pay my respects.

52
00:03:21,900 --> 00:03:22,400
Wait.

53
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:25,140
I am but an ordinary man.

54
00:03:25,140 --> 00:03:26,540
No need for formalities.

55
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:29,360
Thank you, sir, for saving Tang'er.

56
00:03:33,300 --> 00:03:34,500
Take good care of her.

57
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,140
I will.

58
00:03:40,200 --> 00:03:41,000
Please.

59
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:52,530
Will we have a chance to meet again?

60
00:03:57,940 --> 00:03:59,340
If you encounter danger,

61
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:00,400
blow this flute,

62
00:04:01,460 --> 00:04:02,460
and I will appear.

63
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:05,440
Xingcan.

64
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:12,400
I don't need comfort.

65
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:18,680
Whatever decision you make,

66
00:05:19,140 --> 00:05:20,140
just go for it.

67
00:05:20,340 --> 00:05:21,270
I'm here for you.

68
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:40,080
You,

69
00:05:40,820 --> 00:05:41,540
come here.

70
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:48,680
I'm sorry.

71
00:05:49,159 --> 00:05:50,890
It's my fault Uncle Gu got hurt.

72
00:05:51,340 --> 00:05:52,880
If apologies worked,

73
00:05:53,580 --> 00:05:55,440
what would we need the police for?

74
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:57,380
I was a coward before,

75
00:05:57,640 --> 00:05:59,440
so I didn't dare to step forward.

76
00:06:01,140 --> 00:06:02,800
Now I want to give Uncle Gu

77
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:04,140
and you an explanation,

78
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,400
and also give myself one.

79
00:06:06,660 --> 00:06:07,240
Okay.

80
00:06:08,980 --> 00:06:10,200
Then from now on,

81
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:12,080
you do whatever I say.

82
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:13,340
Understood?

83
00:06:14,380 --> 00:06:15,040
Okay.

84
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,760
Okay, I got it.

85
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:36,610
Since the problem is clear now,

86
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:37,700
next,

87
00:06:38,159 --> 00:06:39,200
we must go all out.

88
00:06:49,780 --> 00:06:50,580
Father.

89
00:06:51,740 --> 00:06:52,540
We're here.

90
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,260
We meet again, Miss Gu.

91
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,040
Hello, Uncle.

92
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:10,880
Where are you from, Miss Gu?

93
00:07:11,580 --> 00:07:13,020
Uncle, I'm a local.

94
00:07:17,540 --> 00:07:19,740
What do your parents do?

95
00:07:20,380 --> 00:07:23,400
My mother passed away from illness when I was very young.

96
00:07:23,400 --> 00:07:25,480
I grew up depending on my father.

97
00:07:27,340 --> 00:07:29,500
But on the day I got into law school,

98
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:30,880
my dad

99
00:07:32,940 --> 00:07:34,900
passed away in an accident.

100
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:40,600
Why have I never heard you mention this?

101
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:43,980
It's all in the past.

102
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:47,400
You are a strong girl.

103
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:50,520
Ling Ze,

104
00:07:51,140 --> 00:07:52,380
why did I hear

105
00:07:52,980 --> 00:07:56,440
that you're still using that troublemaking female streamer?

106
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:57,700
Father,

107
00:07:58,260 --> 00:08:00,340
the company is training newcomers now.

108
00:08:00,340 --> 00:08:02,440
That female streamer still has some traffic.

109
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:05,240
I plan to stop using her after drawing the traffic.

110
00:08:05,940 --> 00:08:08,080
Make her pay a price

111
00:08:08,580 --> 00:08:10,180
to let the subordinates know

112
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:13,110
that betraying the Ling family will not end well.

113
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:15,040
Understood, Father.

114
00:08:23,580 --> 00:08:25,840
You two should hurry up with your matter.

115
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:33,600
Okay.

116
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,970
What matter of ours?

117
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:40,919
Father

118
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:42,780
agreed to our marriage.

119
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,580
That's really great.

120
00:08:49,940 --> 00:08:51,640
Mom, let me help you.

121
00:08:54,500 --> 00:08:55,300
It seems

122
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:56,900
Hao Zhenshi was right.

123
00:08:57,140 --> 00:09:00,040
Ling Hengsheng is the mastermind behind all the evil deeds.

124
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:01,940
Ling Ze is just an executor.

125
00:09:02,540 --> 00:09:04,940
I have to overthrow the entire Ling family.

126
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,540
How do you open this thing?

127
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:09,600
You're asking me?

128
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:28,600
Well...

129
00:09:29,140 --> 00:09:31,400
maybe we should leave professional work

130
00:09:31,420 --> 00:09:32,800
to the professionals.

131
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:39,120
Did you guys call a locksmith?

132
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,780
Yes, yes, yes. Please come in.

133
00:09:50,940 --> 00:09:52,400
You want to open this lock?

134
00:09:52,500 --> 00:09:53,140
Yes.

135
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:57,240
I haven't used it for a long time and forgot the password.

136
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:58,540
This lock...

137
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:02,380
is too complicated to open.

138
00:10:03,340 --> 00:10:04,340
It'll cost extra.

139
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,530
What do you mean?

140
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,170
We'll pay extra.

141
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,540
As long as you can open it.

142
00:10:12,540 --> 00:10:13,340
Pay extra?

143
00:10:15,060 --> 00:10:15,840
Alright.

144
00:10:16,540 --> 00:10:17,680
Look at you.

145
00:10:21,740 --> 00:10:23,140
Brother, let me help you.

146
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:24,600
Sure.

147
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:25,840
Come here.

148
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:29,240
Brother, I want to be like you in the future

149
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:30,700
and run the whole company.

150
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:33,640
Okay.

151
00:10:36,460 --> 00:10:36,960
Here,

152
00:10:37,640 --> 00:10:38,440
hold it.

153
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:41,180
Right.

154
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:42,880
Here.

155
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:45,880
It hurts.

156
00:10:46,460 --> 00:10:47,220
It hurts.

157
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:49,280
What's wrong? Let me see.

158
00:10:49,380 --> 00:10:50,380
What's wrong?

159
00:10:52,280 --> 00:10:53,540
How are you watching the child?

160
00:10:53,540 --> 00:10:54,340
Here, let me see.

161
00:10:54,340 --> 00:10:55,960
Mom, Lingyang just...

162
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:56,940
Lingyang came to help

163
00:10:56,940 --> 00:10:58,870
and accidentally burned himself.

164
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:00,900
Are you okay, brother?

165
00:11:00,900 --> 00:11:02,040
Come on, help him up.

166
00:11:06,540 --> 00:11:07,740
Are you done yet?

167
00:11:07,940 --> 00:11:08,800
Almost.

168
00:11:10,700 --> 00:11:12,360
Do you even know how to pick it?

169
00:11:12,580 --> 00:11:13,680
I do.

170
00:11:13,900 --> 00:11:15,440
This lock is quite complicated.

171
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:16,600
It'll take some time.

172
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:17,400
Don't rush me.

173
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:25,040
Hey, is it done?

174
00:11:25,980 --> 00:11:28,240
No, this guy is too slow.

175
00:11:28,400 --> 00:11:30,580
Are you crazy?

176
00:11:31,180 --> 00:11:32,640
We are almost done here.

177
00:11:33,340 --> 00:11:35,080
Leave within 10 minutes.

178
00:11:35,740 --> 00:11:37,040
Remember to restore the scene.

179
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:38,370
Don't leave any traces.

180
00:11:43,180 --> 00:11:44,280
It's open.

181
00:11:45,740 --> 00:11:48,400
What... What are you doing?

182
00:11:48,800 --> 00:11:50,420
What exactly do you do?

183
00:12:00,940 --> 00:12:01,540
Mom.

184
00:12:03,020 --> 00:12:03,880
I'm sorry.

185
00:12:04,540 --> 00:12:06,440
I didn't keep a close eye on my brother today.

186
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:07,040
It's okay.

187
00:12:07,460 --> 00:12:09,390
Yangyang was just being careless.

188
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:11,040
Well,

189
00:12:11,860 --> 00:12:12,980
as for Father,

190
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:14,280
he won't blame you.

191
00:12:14,640 --> 00:12:17,440
He's just mad right now. He'll be fine in a few days.

192
00:12:18,280 --> 00:12:19,540
You should head back now.

193
00:12:19,540 --> 00:12:20,180
Okay.

194
00:12:20,380 --> 00:12:22,110
We'll come see you another day.

195
00:12:22,380 --> 00:12:23,380
Goodbye, Auntie.

196
00:12:26,180 --> 00:12:26,780
Take care.

197
00:12:29,400 --> 00:12:30,000
Let's go.

198
00:12:30,700 --> 00:12:31,500
Let's go home.

199
00:12:33,180 --> 00:12:35,400
Go... go home.

200
00:12:37,800 --> 00:12:39,240
It's none of your business what I do.

201
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:40,240
Open it right now.

202
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:43,200
I'm highly suspicious of your identities right now.

203
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:45,380
If you don't explain clearly, I'll call the police immediately.

204
00:12:45,380 --> 00:12:46,440
Cut the crap.

205
00:12:46,440 --> 00:12:47,320
Open it right now.

206
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:48,140
Impossible.

207
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:56,700
Do you want to go for another walk?

208
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:58,440
It's the weekend, after all.

209
00:12:58,740 --> 00:12:59,740
I'm a bit tired.

210
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:01,340
Let's just go home.

211
00:13:01,540 --> 00:13:02,120
Let's go.

212
00:13:04,280 --> 00:13:05,500
Hurry, they're back.

213
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:06,640
That was fast.

214
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:07,880
You guys...

215
00:13:08,920 --> 00:13:09,980
What are you doing?

216
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:11,080
Give me back my phone.

217
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:12,040
We are not bad people.

218
00:13:12,040 --> 00:13:13,340
You act like this and say you're not bad guys.

219
00:13:13,340 --> 00:13:14,140
Let go.

220
00:13:17,280 --> 00:13:18,360
Want a drink?

221
00:13:19,340 --> 00:13:20,100
How about

222
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:22,380
we go out and find a place to drink?

223
00:13:22,940 --> 00:13:23,880
Sorry, sorry.

224
00:13:25,040 --> 00:13:26,170
Let's drink at home.

225
00:13:30,880 --> 00:13:32,140
Lingze, wait a minute.

226
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:35,280
What's wrong?

227
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:36,880
Nothing.

228
00:13:37,380 --> 00:13:38,580
I'll go change first.

229
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:39,840
Okay.

230
00:14:09,540 --> 00:14:10,600
What's going on?

231
00:14:11,800 --> 00:14:13,200
Why haven't you left yet?

232
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:15,170
I just used my power.

233
00:14:15,940 --> 00:14:17,340
I need to rest for a while.

234
00:14:18,400 --> 00:14:19,660
What happened to them?

235
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:22,400
They are fine.

236
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:29,480
Xingcan.

237
00:14:39,580 --> 00:14:40,680
Did you get it?

238
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:42,380
No.

239
00:14:44,140 --> 00:14:46,270
Forget it. We'll find another chance.

240
00:14:47,400 --> 00:14:48,440
You need to leave now.

241
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:49,400
I'll find a way to cover you.
